        "original_id": "f161e03c-7714-5e8f-9993-c1d40a69c4c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: NBA 2K16, NBA 2K17\n- People: Tony Parker, Dennis Schröder, Marc Gasol, Pau Gasol\n- Organizations: San Antonio Spurs, Atlanta Hawks, Memphis Grizzlies, Chicago Bulls\n- Roles: cover athlete, point guard\n- Concepts: NBA 2K franchise\n\nFacts:\n- NBA 2K16 has regional cover athletes: Tony Parker for the French version, Dennis Schröder for the German version, and Marc Gasol and Pau Gasol for the Spanish version.\n- Tony Parker was with the San Antonio Spurs when he was featured as the French cover athlete for NBA 2K16.\n- Dennis Schröder was with the Atlanta Hawks when he was featured as the German cover athlete for NBA 2K16.\n- Marc Gasol was with the Memphis Grizzlies and Pau Gasol was with the Chicago Bulls when they were featured as the Spanish cover athletes for NBA 2K16.\n- Dennis Schröder plays the point guard position.\n- NBA 2K17 is the 18th installment in the NBA 2K franchise and the successor to NBA 2K16.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
